OmniSeek integrates EmbeddingGemma 2, developed by Google DeepMind and distributed
under Apache License 2.0. Model weights are downloaded separately and are not
included in this repository.
https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2

The SentenceTransformer integration follows the public Google documentation:
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/embeddinggemma/multimodal-embeddinggemma-with-sentence-transformers
Google documentation code samples are available under Apache License 2.0.

FAISS is developed by Meta and contributors, under the MIT license.
https://github.com/facebookresearch/faiss

Lucide icons are used under the ISC license.
https://lucide.dev/license

All dependencies retain their respective licenses. Demo assets are dedicated to
CC0; see assets/demo/LICENSE.txt. Generated embedding fixtures are derived from
these original assets using the separately distributed model.
